---
// @ts-nocheck
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Animation – RWS UI">
	<!-- Hero -->
	<section class="grid min-h-[min(calc(100svh-16rem),48rem)] place-items-center pt-20 pb-20 md:pt-24 md:pb-24 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-32" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 text-center lg:px-12">
			<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
				<p>Animation examples</p>
			</div>

			<h1 class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-[16ch] text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl">
				<p>Does your AI actually <em>speak the language</em>?</p>
			</h1>

			<div class="mx-auto prose prose-xl mb-8 max-w-[56ch] text-foreground-muted md:prose-2xl">
				<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Quos reprehenderit libero ut eligendi? Laudantium quod quas asperiores magni dolore.</p>
			</div>

			<div hidden class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
				<a href="/trainai-bench/leaderboard" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl">View leaderboard</a>
				<a href="/trainai-bench/methodology" class="btn btn-outline btn-xl">Read methodology</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="dots">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-16">
			<div class="lg:col-span-6">
				<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
					<p>One partner, one journey</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pretty xl:text-5xl">
					<p><em>A fully integrated</em> clinical trial assessment</p>
				</h2>

				<div class="prose text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
					<p>Managing COA licensing, linguistic validation and eCOA work across separate suppliers is one of the most common sources of delay in global study start-up. We bring the whole journey into one program with a single partner throughout.</p>
				</div>

				<div hidden class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-icon-right">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
							<rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect>
							<line x1="40" y1="128" x2="216" y2="128" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line>
							<polyline points="168 80 216 128 168 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline>
						</svg>
						Find out more
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="lg:order-first lg:col-span-6">
				<div>
					<img src="/animations/1.svg" alt="First animation example" class="h-auto w-full" data-inline-svg />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-16">
			<div class="lg:col-span-6">
				<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
					<p>Right first time, every time</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pretty xl:text-5xl">
					<p>An approval guaranteed workflow for global instruments</p>
				</h2>

				<div class="prose text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
					<p>From instrument access and source validation through linguistic validation, eCOA deployment and rater training, we help pharmaceutical companies and CROs accelerate study start-up, protect data integrity and reduce regulatory risk. Getting an instrument right before it reaches patients avoids the rework, resubmission and delay that come from a translation that fails review.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-icon-right">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
							<rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect>
							<line x1="40" y1="128" x2="216" y2="128" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line>
							<polyline points="168 80 216 128 168 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline>
						</svg>
						Find out more
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="lg:col-span-6">
				<div>
					<img src="/animations/2.svg" alt="Second animation example" class="h-auto w-full" data-inline-svg />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="pale">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-16">
			<div class="lg:col-span-6">
				<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
					<p>Fewer gaps, faster start</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pretty xl:text-5xl">
					<p><em>Accelerate study start-up</em> without trading away quality</p>
				</h2>

				<div class="prose text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
					<p>Coordination gaps between sponsor, eCOA vendor and translation provider are where time is lost. By closing those gaps, holding data integrity and delivering audit-ready quality across 350+ language pairs, we help you move from protocol to first site faster while keeping regulatory confidence intact.</p>
				</div>

				<div hidden class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-icon-right">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
							<rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect>
							<line x1="40" y1="128" x2="216" y2="128" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line>
							<polyline points="168 80 216 128 168 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline>
						</svg>
						Find out more
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="lg:order-first lg:col-span-6">
				<div>
					<img src="/animations/3.svg" alt="" class="h-auto w-full" data-inline-svg />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="h-[100svh]" data-theme="tertiary"></section>
</Layout>
